jobs.duty:
At Li Auto, our Overseas Product Marketing team needs more than just copywriters—we need interpreters who can bridge the gap between engineering language and global customer perception. Designed for engineering graduates, this role will groom you to become a core force in overseas product communication and value proposition strategy.
1.Technical Feature Translation: Gain deep insights into Li Auto's core technologies (e.g., EREV/extended-range electric systems, autonomous driving, and smart cockpit). Translate technical specs and engineering logic into relatable, memorable product features and key messaging for global users;
2.Product Communication Asset Support: Partner with product, PR, and social media teams to curate and localize product launch and promotional assets, ensuring technical accuracy and consistent brand positioning;
3.Competitive Intelligence: Track competitor dynamics and tech narratives in key overseas markets (Middle East, Central Asia, Europe, etc.), providing structured insights to help refine our feature messaging strategies;
4.Product Events Support: Support the planning, keynote drafting, and execution of online/offline events, including global auto shows and product launch events.

